WEBVTT

00:30:28.375 --> 00:30:31.708
and the more possibilities you can
sketch out for helping one another.

00:30:32.625 --> 00:30:36.351
So Christiana asked each country
about their future aspirations.

00:30:36.375 --> 00:30:41.059
CF: Maybe one of the most surprising
is the conversations with Saudi Arabia.

00:30:41.083 --> 00:30:44.434
AG: Christiana had meetings
in Bedouin tents and oil fields

00:30:44.458 --> 00:30:46.684
outside in the scorching desert heat.

00:30:46.708 --> 00:30:49.518
CF: And they very well understood

00:30:49.542 --> 00:30:52.059
that 20, 30, 40 years from now,

00:30:52.083 --> 00:30:55.018
it was probable
that they're going to be living

00:30:55.042 --> 00:30:58.726
in completely uninhabitable areas
because of the heat.

00:30:58.750 --> 00:31:01.059
They understand that.